---
description: Prepare one requestClearance evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: RightsFinding[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Form a precise clearance request describing the actual use, audience, modifications, and duration. Track responses and conditions without treating informal enthusiasm as a license, and maintain restricted access to private donor or participant information. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
